  "body": "Right now it seems that `auto_join_rooms` forces new users into the configured rooms. Some may not want this for privacy reasons, but a feature like this could make sure that users are aware of certain rooms - such as in my case, the community room of my server.\r\n\r\nIt would be great if this would (or could, optionally) be only an invite rather than a direct join, so the users have a choice.\r\nAs discussed in the synapse-admins room, maybe the system user from the `send_server_notice` api could handle the invite here.",
